OL,3,AEurope under pressure to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he may
OL,7,Fask European countries to release
OL,8,Fdiesel reserves as he considers banning
OL,9,FUS exports of the fuel
OL,11,FThe move could bring prices down
OL,12,Fsignificantly for American drivers, but
OL,13,Fexperts warn it would put further
OL,14,Fpressure on diesel prices in other
OL,15,Fcountries
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
