OL,3,AEurope under pressure to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis comment comes as diesel prices in
OL,7,Fthe UK hit record highs this week and
OL,8,Fare hovering at just under 200p per
OL,9,Flitre, according to motoring
OL,10,Forganisation the RAC, as the Iran war
OL,11,Fputs pressure on the supply of refined
OL,12,Ffuels
OL,14,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,15,Fthe world, exporting between 1.2 and
OL,16,F1.5 million barrels per day. More than
OL,17,Fhalf of the UK's diesel is imported,
OL,18,Fwith 31% of the imports coming from the
OL,19,FUS
OL,21,FEuropean ministers are meeting on
OL,22,FFriday to discuss the potential ban
